                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400" id="partA-score">0 / 5 Solved</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                    Read each sentence from Exercise 1 Part A. Decide if the underlined verb phrase describes an action happening <strong>right now (P)</strong> or a <strong>scheduled future event (F)</strong>.
                </p>

                <div class="space-y-4" id="partA-container">
                    <!-- Dynamic rendering by JS -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- PART B: Dialogue Completion ("be going to") -->
